  "description": "Woochan, a cooking YouTuber, decides to go car camping with his friend and lover, Hyunwoo, to create new content.\nAfter successfully finishing their livestream and just as they’re about to fall asleep, a sudden earthquake strikes!\nOutside the car is a dark cave, and in the pitch-black darkness, countless tentacles reach out to swallow them whole… Can they escape this place? Or will they even survive long enough to try?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000065651), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1286012322)  \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_4141)",
